# Pydantic was pinned to 2.5.0 (November 2023). That single pin held FastAPI at
# 0.125 and Starlette at 0.50 in this service's lock, while the other services
# resolved to Starlette 1.6 -- three Starlette majors across one deployment,
# with the ASGI behaviour and the security fixes differing between them
# (WILDBO-DEP-01). Ranged so the whole platform converges on one resolution.
